# ============================================================================
# ST-EoS .gitignore
# 入库范围 = 代码（steos/ scripts/ tests/）、论文（paper/）、精选图
# （figures/ paper_figures_png/）、配置（configs/）、 vendored 参考
# （third_party/）、根文档（README/FINDINGS/REVISION2_STATUS/TODO）。
# 一切可再生产物、大文件、内部过程文档一律本地保留。
# ============================================================================

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Virtual environments ---
.venv/
venv/

# --- Secrets / credentials（绝不入库） ---
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# --- 实验产物与模型权重（runs/ 是本地档案，可再生产物不入库） ---
/runs/
*.npz
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors
wandb/

# --- 数据集与大数据盘挂载 ---
/data/
bigdisk

# --- 本地专属文档与状态（内部审稿过程、哨兵、备份、派生输出） ---
AGENTS.md
/docs/reviews/
.state/
/backups/
/analysis_out/
/artifacts/
.slim/

# --- LaTeX 构建产物（.tex / .bib / .pdf 保留入库） ---
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex(busy)
*.xdv
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.bcf
*.run.xml
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb

# --- 图片草稿快照（figures/ 与 paper_figures_png/ 的定稿保持跟踪） ---
figures/_prev_*
figures/_preview_*
figures/etad_round12_backup/
figures/etad_round13_log.txt
figures/unused/

# --- third_party 为有意 vendored 的参考代码，保持跟踪 ---
!third_party/

# --- OS / 编辑器杂物 ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
*.orig
*.rej
.vscode/
.idea/
